#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:5
msgid "Invert the selection"
msgstr "反转选择"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:7
msgid ""
"Some times is easier to select the objects from the `workspace`_ which are "
"not interested for the desired action than the objects which should be "
"selected. For this reason, QElectroTech provides the option to invert the "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"有时从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择对想要的动作不感兴趣的对象比选择的对象容易。为此原因，QEelectroTech "
"提供了对选择进行反转的选项 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:11
msgid ""
"Inverting the selection can be done from `menu bar`_ or using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "反转选择可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 中完成，也可以使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:14
msgid "Invert selection from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中反向选择"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:16
#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Select the object/s`_ from the activated `folio`_ which are not interested "
"for the desired action."
msgstr ""
"` 从已激活的 `组 <Select the object/s_>`_ 中选择对想要的行动不感兴趣的对象/s <Select the "
"object/s_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:17
msgid "Select **Edit > Invert selection** to invert the selection."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 反向选择** 以反转选择 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:25
msgid "Invert selection using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键反转选择"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:27
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:30
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + i`` to invert the selection."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + i`` 颠倒选择。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/select/select_invert.rst:34
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
